<section id="questions">
  <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-num">07</span><h2>Questions to ask them</h2></div>
  <p class="sec-sub">Each one advertises something you know without asserting it. Pick two or three.</p>

  <ol class="qlist">
    <li>What does endpoint qualification look like today — what does a provider actually have to prove before it can serve a slug?<span class="why">Signals you know that catalog membership and weight identity are different facts.</span></li>
    <li>Is realized cache-hit rate measured per endpoint, and does routing policy use it — or is the advertised cache discount taken at face value?<span class="why">Goes straight at the research thread you most want.</span></li>
    <li>Where does the fp4-versus-fp8 quality question sit internally? Is anyone measuring the delta on agentic tasks specifically?<span class="why">Names an axis that's visible in your own API and unpriced in the market.</span></li>
    <li>How do you think about app rankings — marketing surface, or research dataset? The app is a confound on model quality and also the most interesting variable in it.<span class="why">Shows you've thought about their data the way a scientist would.</span></li>
    <li>What's the split between agentic tool-calling traffic and conversational traffic, and is routing policy differentiated for it? The economics look completely different at 85–99% cache read.<span class="why">Backed by your own measured numbers.</span></li>
  </ol>
</section>

